## Appendix A: Quick Reference Guides

### Common Troubleshooting Commands

**Windows:**
```
ipconfig /all - Network configuration
ipconfig /release - Release DHCP
ipconfig /renew - Renew DHCP
ipconfig /flushdns - Clear DNS cache
ping [address] - Test connectivity
tracert [address] - Trace route
netstat -an - Network connections
sfc /scannow - System file check
chkdsk /f /r - Disk check and repair
systeminfo - System information
gpupdate /force - Update group policy
powercfg /batteryreport - Battery report
```

**macOS:**
```
ifconfig - Network configuration
ping [address] - Test connectivity
traceroute [address] - Trace route
networksetup -listallhardwareports - Network interfaces
diskutil list - List disks
diskutil verifyDisk - Verify disk
sudo dscacheutil -flushcache - Clear DNS cache
top - System monitoring
```

**Linux:**
```
ifconfig / ip addr - Network configuration
ping [address] - Test connectivity
traceroute [address] - Trace route
netstat -tuln - Network connections
df -h - Disk usage
top / htop - System monitoring
systemctl status [service] - Service status
sudo apt update - Update package list
journalctl -xe - System logs
```

### Priority Matrix

| Impact/Urgency | High Impact | Low Impact |
|---------------|-------------|------------|
| **High Urgency** | P1 - Critical: Immediate response required | P2 - High: Respond within 2 hours |
| **Low Urgency** | P2 - High: Respond within 4 hours | P3 - Medium: Respond within 24 hours |

### Essential Certifications

**Entry-Level:**
- CompTIA A+ (Core requirement)
- CompTIA Network+
- Google IT Support Professional Certificate

**Intermediate:**
- CompTIA Security+
- Microsoft 365 Certified: Fundamentals
- ITIL Foundation

**Advanced Specialization:**
- CompTIA CySA+ (Cybersecurity)
- CCNA (Networking)
- AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner
- Microsoft Certified: Azure Administrator

